cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the IJAM 2011 article below (preferred
  citation) and, where appropriate, this repository.
title: "qlpca: quasi-linear PCA in Python, with a replication of the PhD thesis"
abstract: >-
  qlpca is a Python package for quasi-linear PCA (qlPCA): an extension of
  principal components analysis to nonlinear relations through low-order
  spline transformations of continuous variables, fitted by alternating least
  squares. The repository also contains a chapter-by-chapter replication of
  the PhD thesis in which the method was proposed (Lavado, 2012).
